(* Lane H: Oracle7's network_v3 specialist fusion as a HOL decision over a
   pool of typed quantities, with lane G's quantity kernel as the nodes.
   Imports lane G's session (Veri7vn_Quantity, cached) so the fusion
   theorems quantify over the real kernels.
   Lane H2: Fusion_Nodes adds the thermo (lane S06), carboncapture (lane S05)
   and planetary (lane S02) nodes. A session has one parent heap, so the
   theories it needs from those sessions (Energy_Core, Thermo; Climate_Num,
   Climate; Space_Tables, Space) are checked again inside this session. *)
session Veri7vn_Fusion = Veri7vn_Quantity +
  options [document = false, threads = 2]
  sessions
    Veri7vn_Commons
    Veri7vn_Energy_Base Veri7vn_Energy
    Veri7vn_Climate_Base Veri7vn_Climate
    Veri7vn_Space_Base Veri7vn_Space
  theories
    Fusion
    Fusion_Nodes
    Fusion_Export
